M09_KeyCard_Zone soft-lock guard. The zone (2000458, Script_Zone_Star) sends
the containment-door key check only when Mobius is within 15 m. If Havoc
enters first, the 2 s DIST_CHECK loop keeps running while he stays inside but
compares the distance measured on entry, so it can never succeed; a player
waiting at the door for a trailing Mobius never gets the door. Re-measure the
distance on each pass. Entry with Mobius close, exit/re-entry and every reply
path are unchanged; the check still fires at most once per loop.

--- a/Mission09.cpp
+++ b/Mission09.cpp
@@ -4367,6 +4367,16 @@
 	{
 		if (timer_id == DIST_CHECK && star_in_zone)
 		{
+			// Vita soft-lock guard: the original re-check only compared the
+			// distance measured on entry, so a player waiting in this
+			// star-only zone for a trailing Mobius never got the door check.
+			// Re-measure it each pass; entry with Mobius close is unchanged.
+			mobius = Commands->Find_Object (2000010);
+			if (mobius != NULL)
+			{
+				mobius_distance = Commands->Get_Distance(Commands->Get_Position (STAR), Commands->Get_Position (mobius));
+			}
+
 			if (mobius_distance <= 15.0/* && !fired_off*/)
